      "message": "test(2d): pin the side tolerance and keep the #3825 plunge test as a plain pin\n\nThe #3823 test fig8_outside_offset_has_no_plunge_into_material passes now:\nits known-fail #3825 marker goes. A unit pin shows that the 10 um side\ntolerance keeps a real 0.1 mm wall stretch 50 um off the start side, and\nreads a stretch 5 um off as the start side.\n\nRefs #3824\nRefs #3825\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
